{"id": "bart-power-washing-contract-false-claims", "title": "BART recovered $11,900 after cameras contradicted station cleaning bills", "seconds": 84.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "24aa8a927b87e71e", "words": 189, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A truck’s GPS put it at the station. BART footage showed nobody power washed that night.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.51, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "the", "camera", "see?"], "sub": "24th Street Mission station"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.53, 1.21, 1.4, 1.49, 1.61, 1.72, 3.05, 3.46, 3.87, 4.32, 4.83, 5.25, 5.66, 5.95]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "One contract covered the two Mission stations nightly. Another covered stations on a weekly schedule.", "t0": 6.63, "t1": 12.72, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Two FY2020 contracts", "heading": "What the contractor agreed to clean", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Mission stations", "value": "Every night"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Other stations", "value": "Weekly schedule"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.86, 1.21, 1.31, 1.57, 1.94, 2.44, 3.58, 4.06, 4.42, 4.95, 5.06, 5.14, 5.55]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The contractor prepared the September reports after investigators asked to see them.", "t0": 12.84, "t1": 17.54, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "Inspector General", "text": "Daily work reports", "mark": "Daily work reports"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.77, 1.33, 1.45, 1.99, 2.82, 3.12, 3.87, 4.13, 4.26, 4.49]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The investigators documented 22 charges. A BART employee documented another 25.", "t0": 17.76, "t1": 24.37, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "September 2023", "heading": "Two independently documented sets", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "Investigation · 22 charges", "value": "$5,100"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Employee · 25 charges", "value": "$6,800"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 1.02, 1.62, 2.33, 3.51, 3.66, 3.9, 4.53, 5.2, 5.72]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Station video, photographs and visits backed up the findings.", "t0": 24.49, "t1": 29.38, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "September investigation", "text": "Footage from the station", "mark": "Footage from the station"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.57, 1.46, 2.22, 2.38, 2.86, 3.2, 3.36, 3.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Together the charges totaled $11,900.", "t0": 29.38, "t1": 33.4, "shot": "r4b", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$11,900", "label": "Missed or deficient September cleanings"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.49, 0.62, 1.13, 1.62, 2.13, 2.7, 3.08, 3.44]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The contractor disputed the finding and said it had provided additional, unbilled services.", "t0": 33.52, "t1": 39.72, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$13,350", "label": "Additional work the contractor said it had not billed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.8, 1.35, 1.47, 2.08, 2.37, 2.55, 2.65, 2.82, 3.38, 4.54, 5.42]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "BART sometimes redirected crews.", "t0": 39.84, "t1": 42.61, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "September investigation", "text": "Unscheduled assignments", "mark": "Unscheduled assignments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 1.08, 1.75]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The investigators found no written change order substituting those jobs on the invoices.", "t0": 42.61, "t1": 47.85, "shot": "r6b", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "flow", "context": "Unscheduled assignments", "heading": "How to change the schedule", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "BART request", "value": "Written notice"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Contractor response", "value": "Written proposal"}, {"icon": "gap", "label": "Substitution on invoice", "value": "Change order missing"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.99, 1.33, 1.6, 1.94, 2.3, 2.87, 3.66, 3.91, 4.31, 4.42, 4.53]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A BART employee had already withheld over $149,000 in invoices.", "t0": 48.07, "t1": 54.11, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$149,000+", "label": "Invoice payments withheld by a BART employee"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 1.09, 1.29, 1.75, 2.37, 2.65, 2.94, 3.37, 4.02, 4.47, 5.07, 5.28]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "BART released the payments because it had missed its own contract notice requirements.", "t0": 54.23, "t1": 58.77, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "District oversight", "text": "Breach notice requirements", "mark": "Breach notice requirements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.79, 0.91, 1.38, 1.77, 1.87, 2.04, 2.39, 2.59, 2.88, 3.48, 3.8]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The employee also reported retaliation.", "t0": 58.89, "t1": 62.71, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "September investigation", "text": "Employee complaint", "mark": "Employee complaint"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.9, 1.41, 1.91]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Inspector General reviewed the actions and found them allowable.", "t0": 62.71, "t1": 66.04, "shot": "r9b", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Employee complaint", "heading": "Two conclusions in the investigation", "source": "investigation", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Contract billing", "value": "Substantiated"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "Reported retaliation", "value": "Actions found allowable"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.76, 1.15, 1.63, 1.78, 2.2, 2.34, 2.58, 2.73]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "BART’s counsel settled for the amount investigators had documented in the two evidence tables.", "t0": 66.16, "t1": 71.39, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "investigation", "kicker": "General Counsel response", "text": "July 2024 settlement", "mark": "July 2024 settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 1.08, 1.47, 1.61, 1.73, 2.14, 2.9, 3.05, 3.68, 3.8, 3.93, 4.28, 4.71]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Inspector General confirmed that BART recovered the full $11,900.", "t0": 71.51, "t1": 77.49, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$11,900", "label": "Recovered, per the Inspector General’s FY2025 report"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.76, 1.15, 1.65, 1.83, 2.18, 2.63, 2.78, 3.49, 3.99, 4.73, 5.09, 5.44]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The district settled without pursuing additional civil penalties.", "t0": 77.61, "t1": 81.08, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Case disposition", "heading": "What happened after settlement", "source": "dashboard", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Recovery", "value": "Implemented"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Additional penalties", "value": "Not pursued"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.65, 1.09, 1.43, 1.96, 2.48, 2.81]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 81.2, "t1": 83.83, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "A truck at the station", "b": "Reconstruct the bill", "o": "What BART recovered"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}